flowchart TD
    ContentSource[(Content Store)]
    Crawler[Crawler Service]
    ParserService[Parser Service]
    Tokenizer[Tokenizer]
    IndexBuilder[Index Builder]
    SearchIndex[(Search Index)]
    User((User))
    QueryService[Query Service]
    RankingService[Ranking Service]

    Crawler -->|fetch documents| ContentSource
    Crawler -->|send raw content| ParserService
    ParserService -->|extract text| Tokenizer
    Tokenizer -->|emit tokens| IndexBuilder
    IndexBuilder -->|write index| SearchIndex
    User -->|submits search query| QueryService
    QueryService -->|lookup terms| SearchIndex
    SearchIndex -->|return matches| RankingService
    RankingService -->|return ranked results| QueryService
    QueryService -->|display results| User
